# 基础词 Unit25
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023红宝书考研英语词汇-基础词
# 描述: 基础词Unit25核心词汇

{{heart}}{/hɑːrt/}}n. 心脏；内心；核心}}{{She has a kind heart and always helps others.}}
{{heat}}{/hiːt/}}n. 热；v. 加热}}{{The heat in summer can be unbearable.}}
{{heaven}}{/ˈhevn/}}n. 天堂；天空}}{{The sunset looked like a painting from heaven.}}
{{heavy}}{/ˈhevi/}}adj. 重的；大量的}}{{The heavy rain lasted for three days.}}
{{heel}}{/hiːl/}}n. 脚后跟；鞋跟}}{{She wore high heels to the formal event.}}
{{height}}{/haɪt/}}n. 高度；身高}}{{The height of the building is about 100 meters.}}
{{helicopter}}{/ˈhelɪkɒptər/}}n. 直升机}}{{The helicopter landed on the roof of the hospital.}}
{{help}}{/help/}}v. 帮助；n. 帮助}}{{Can you help me carry these bags?}}
{{heritage}}{/ˈherɪtɪdʒ/}}n. 遗产；传统}}{{The city is proud of its rich cultural heritage.}}
{{hero}}{/ˈhɪərəʊ/}}n. 英雄；主角}}{{The firefighter was hailed as a hero for saving the child.}}
{{hide}}{/haɪd/}}v. 隐藏；n. 兽皮}}{{The sun hid behind the clouds.}}
{{high}}{/haɪ/}}adj. 高的；adv. 高地}}{{The plane flew high above the clouds.}}
{{highlight}}{/ˈhaɪlaɪt/}}v. 强调；n. 最精彩的部分}}{{The report highlights the need for more research.}}
{{highly}}{/ˈhaɪli/}}adv. 非常；高度地}}{{She is a highly respected科学家in her field.}}
{{hill}}{/hɪl/}}n. 小山；丘陵}}{{They climbed the hill to enjoy the panoramic view.}}
{{hint}}{/hɪnt/}}n. 暗示；提示；v. 暗示}}{{She gave me a hint about the surprise party.}}
{{hire}}{/ˈhaɪər/}}v. 雇用；租借}}{{The company plans to hire 50 new employees this year.}}
{{history}}{/ˈhɪstri/}}n. 历史；经历}}{{The history of this ancient city dates back 2,000 years.}}
{{hit}}{/hɪt/}}v. 打；击中；n. 成功}}{{The song became a hit immediately after its release.}}
{{hold}}{/həʊld/}}v. 拿住；举行；容纳}}{{The stadium can hold up to 80,000 spectators.}}
{{hole}}{/həʊl/}}n. 洞；孔}}{{The dog dug a hole in the backyard.}}
{{holiday}}{/ˈhɒlədeɪ/}}n. 假日；节日}}{{We spent the holiday at the beach resort.}}
{{holy}}{/ˈhəʊli/}}adj. 神圣的；圣洁的}}{{The temple is considered a holy place by many believers.}}
{{home}}{/həʊm/}}n. 家；adv. 回家}}{{There is no place like home.}}
{{honest}}{/ˈɒnɪst/}}adj. 诚实的；正直的}}{{He is an honest man who always tells the truth.}}
{{honey}}{/ˈhʌni/}}n. 蜂蜜；亲爱的}}{{Honey is a natural sweetener with many health benefits.}}
{{honor}}{/ˈɒnər/}}n. 荣誉；v. 尊敬}}{{It is an honor to receive this prestigious award.}}
{{hook}}{/hʊk/}}n. 钩子；v. 钩住}}{{She hung her coat on the hook by the door.}}
{{hope}}{/həʊp/}}n./v. 希望}}{{I hope to see you again soon.}}
{{horrible}}{/ˈhɒrəbl/}}adj. 可怕的；糟糕的}}{{The accident was a horrible experience for everyone involved.}}
{{horror}}{/ˈhɒrər/}}n. 恐怖；恐惧}}{{The horror movie scared the audience.}}
{{host}}{/həʊst/}}n. 主人；主持人；v. 主办}}{{China will host the international conference next year.}}
{{hot}}{/hɒt/}}adj. 热的；辣的}}{{The weather is extremely hot in summer here.}}
{{hotel}}{/həʊˈtel/}}n. 宾馆；酒店}}{{We booked a room at a five-star hotel.}}
{{hour}}{/ˈaʊər/}}n. 小时}}{{The meeting lasted for about two hours.}}
{{house}}{/haʊs/}}n. 房子；v. 提供住房}}{{They bought a house in the suburbs last year.}}
{{household}}{/ˈhaʊshəʊld/}}n. 家庭；adj. 家用的}}{{The average household income has increased this year.}}
{{housing}}{/ˈhaʊzɪŋ/}}n. 住房；住宅}}{{The government is building affordable housing for low-income families.}}
{{huge}}{/hjuːdʒ/}}adj. 巨大的；庞大的}}{{The project requires a huge investment of time and money.}}
{{human}}{/ˈhjuːmən/}}adj. 人类的；n. 人}}{{Human beings have the ability to think and reason.}}
